{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PineScreen 是一款以運動與學習挑戰換取螢幕時間的應用程式，適合經常瀏覽 TikTok、Instagram、YouTube，或在睡前、讀書與工作時容易分心的人。它透過完成掌上壓、深蹲、高抬腿及學習測驗來換取額外使用時間，並提供自訂封鎖時段與漸進減量計劃；現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-222.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>運動學習換取螢幕時間</h2>\n<p>PineScreen 透過掌上壓、深蹲與高抬腿等相機輔助計數挑戰，讓使用者在想繼續使用手機時先完成運動，換取額外螢幕時間；亦可選擇英文詞彙、填空與知識測驗等學習挑戰。應用程式提供自訂封鎖時段、睡前、學習與工作預設模式，以及每天減少一分鐘的漸進計劃，協助建立可持續的數碼習慣。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-32-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-33-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-34-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-35-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-36-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PineScreen: Push Up Blocker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pinescreen-push-up-blocker/id6446350660?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.732363+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:24:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:40.831429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:26.608282+00:00","content_hash":"085e6d4711c701349e276adc5fc670bdd47a45a5cb3e537f067d6ec491109bd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}